<title>JAPAN: Mars Engineering to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Mars Engineering to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mars Engineering Co Ltd said on Monday that it would buy back up to 190,000 of its shares, or up to 500 million yen worth.</p>
<p>Mars makes components for pachinko &quot;pinball&quot; parlours.</p>
